# The one image built from the app root is the companion's
# (docker/companion/Dockerfile; every other build has its own context). This
# list admits only what it copies (src/appstamp.ts BAKED_PATHS, entry for entry —
# the stamp is a hash over exactly these). Everything else in the checkout —
# state, evidence, node_modules, the operator's files — stays out.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!dist
!src
!extensions
!agents
!prompts
!seeds
!profiles
!docker/companion
**/node_modules
**/.git
